# CAREGRAPH runs fully offline by default. Copy to .env only if you want the
# plain-language explanations generated by a real model instead of the built-in
# deterministic generator.
#
# Never commit a real key. The app reads keys from the environment only; they are
# never written to disk, logged, or exposed to the browser.

# CAREGRAPH_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# CAREGRAPH_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
